### Step 3: Architecture Check
This modular configuration ensures your application remains resilient and maintainable:
```
                  [ JournalPostingWizard.jsx ]
                    (Holds global Stepper State)
                               |
        +----------------------+----------------------+
        |                      |                      |
[Step 0: Selection]    [Step 1: Method]       [Step 2: Execution]
                                              /               \
                          [ManualPosting.jsx]           [BulkUpload.jsx]

```
When a user selects an entry path, the child triggers onNext(). If they select **Excel Upload**, entryMethod evaluates to BULK and mounts JournalBulkUpload.jsx onto Step 3 instantly. All metadata fields remain structured, the layout balances symmetrically, and you prevent code duplication!
